                      "id": "w8uFr",
                      "name": "faq1a",
                      "fill": "#737373",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Yes. mac_sweep uses a safe removal process that identifies all related files (preferences, caches, logs) before deletion. You always get a preview of what will be removed, and nothing is deleted without your explicit confirmation.",
