                      "fill": "#737373",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "mac_sweep targets developer tool caches (Xcode, npm, CocoaPods, Gradle, pip, Homebrew, Docker and more), browser caches, and system caches. Each category shows you exactly how much space it occupies before you decide to clean.",
